{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rebirth of Legal Maniac 2&quot; is a visually engaging and suspenseful interactive novel. Players take on the role of lawyer Zhang Yu, whose relentless pursuit of absolute justice, disregarding reality, leads to career setbacks, alienation, and a desperate situation. On the verge of death, he unexpectedly gains a new lease on life through the consciousness of the super digital life form Liu Zihua, endowing him with unparalleled physical abilities and Liu Zihua's extensive network of resources. Using his superpowers and a series of ruthless legal measures, he fights for the basic civil rights of the oppressed lower classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players make crucial choices that drive the plot forward and influence the characters' fates, resulting in multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhang Yu engages in captivating interactions with numerous female characters, including the aloof and glamorous CEO of a listed tech company, Bai Rou, the domineering heiress of a conglomerate, Ouyang Didi, a battle against a super-powered female ninja transformed by the FX Group, a female demon beyond his comprehension, and a mysterious master who guides him to master the power of will that transcends dimensions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296630/extras/adb311cf34875152f3f024adda4e34a4.avif?t=1772379465\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296630/extras/f7e72a8b68a46736886ba8095fcf42ba.avif?t=1772379465\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296630/extras/a106ea4fd07c98685f97a